      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think the problem is caused by the VRC Light Volumes used in the avatar shader being updated to 2.0.0. I changed the VRC Light Volumes shader code and the problem seems to have been alleviated a little, but the stuttering still seems to occur. It may be possible to improve this by making changes to the shader loading method, but I'm not sure if that's possible.\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/2022.3/Documentation/Manual/shader-loading.html",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
