      "statusChangeID": "68a39bbfc5203e7e46103dab",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Since this was traced to VRC Light Volumes, there is not much we can do on our side. Shader loading specifically followed regular Unity flows, and as such can't really be optimized much more. Affected avatars should update to the latest versions of LV-supported shaders.\n\nPlease feel free to comment if you believe there is still an actual bug on our end.",
